<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>For The Honour Of The Republic</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Weeks after the nuclear destruction of Lisbon in the opening act of World War 3, the Portuguese Armed Forces finally have a chance at retribution.&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;A Kiev-class carrier has managed to neutralize its NATO shadow group and cross the Cape of Good Hope, breaking into the South Atlantic. With most naval assets tied up in the Arctic, Baltic and Mediterranean, nothing stands between the Kiev’s surface action group and NATO’s Trans-Atlantic supply lines.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Two squadrons of the Portuguese Air Force are hastily ferried to Gran Canaria AFB. Their orders:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;“Sink the Kiev. For the honour of the Republic.”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;- Scenario by Gonçalo “Scorpion86” Prôa&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>3</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>4</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>South Atlantic</ScenSetting>
  <ScenDate>1991</ScenDate>
